    "title": "Same creed, different results: Wyoming's passing game hunts for its 1/11th - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Vic Aquino ,\n13 hours ago Head coaches Jay Sawvel of Wyoming and Ken Niumatalolo of SJSU are preaching from the same hymnal this week, but only one team is currently hitting the notes. After North Dakota State shut out Wyoming 28-0 in the Fargodome last Saturday, Sawvel’s fix for his Cowboy offense boiled down to three words recognized anywhere: “Do. Your. Job.” Read full article",
